  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical feasibility assessment for developing a Green Special Economic Zone (GSEZ) in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK has been supporting the development of a Green Special Economic Zone (GSEZ) in Cambodia under the UK-Cambodia Strategic Infrastructure Partnership. 
In the last phase that ended in April&#x2019;25, strong progress was made to transform the concept to reality. To advance the project into implementation, a Technical Feasibility Study (FS) is required to provide a comprehensive technical foundation for the GSEZ project. The study will include needs and options analysis, technical feasibility, project scoping, cost estimation and output specifications.</narrative>
  </description>
